# Plate & stage engine

Read module headers in **`plate.ts`** and **`stage.ts`** before changing behavior.

## Dual iframe (`#plateFrame` / `#plateFrameBack`)

- Back frame **preloads** next plate; ids swap so scrub/caption changes **never blank** the visible frame.
- **`backReady`** + **`backArmedSrc`** must match actual back `src` — otherwise same-plate scrub shows **stale HTML** (shrink/wrong zoom).
- Preload **must not cancel** a back load the stage is waiting on (`BackLoad.shown`).
- **`force: true`** on look/palette reload — ready-cache must not serve pre-look frames (`lifecycle.ts`).

## Fit & output frame

- **`fitFhdPreview`**: retry when pane is 0×0; **never crop** — whole `video.output` frame visible (`--wt-frame-w/h`).
- **`refitPlateCompositionDeferred`**: after unhide/swap when `#fhdFit` was hidden — fixes post-scrub shrink.

## Stage compositing (`stage.ts`)

- **One iframe policy**: don’t steal front frame for prefetch while a **live card** is on stage.
- **Lens/zoom on recordings only** — animated **plates** have no render camera; Layers tab should say so. **Chapter/caption cards** use card bake overlays, not recording lens.
- Plate zoom **must not outlive** the plate slide — tuck lens layer when leaving; no **black** placeholder for transparent cards.
- Switch of slide/lens/source is **not** a seek dip — avoid flashing previous slide pixels under loupe.
- Cancelled preload must **not blacklist** plate (blank Opening after omit/reorder).

## Copy / motion on plate

- **`composePlateForEdit`** + **`pinLiveAnimationFrames`** before inline edit; peak frame from **`plateEditPeakSec`**.
- **`invalidatePlates` / look reload**: drop preloaded plates when direction changes backgrounds.
- Accent popover: **must not steal focus** from plate selection (`lifecycle.ts`).

## Magnifier (recordings)

- Lens marks on canvas (`WeakMap`); shader should read as **glass**, not flat magnified bitmap.
- Controls/tooltip: **outside** lens circle, **above** overflow:hidden ancestors.

## When editing this code

1. Add or extend **unit tests** in `platePick.test.ts`, `plateCss.test.ts`, `lensScrub.test.ts`, etc.
2. Manual: scrub across **plate → live → plate**, edit magnifier, scrub back.
3. If changing cache keys, check **produce** still invalidates when `video.config.json` edit fields change.
